    {
      "id": "6b91c914-bac6-402f-8bfe-bf0f21498da2",
      "name": "Generate Study Plan AI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        16736,
        3136
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an experienced exam coach. You build study plans that a real, tired student can actually follow - not an idealised timetable.\n\nCONTEXT\nSubject: {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.subject }}\nExam date: {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.exam_date }}\nToday: {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.today }}\nDays remaining (today included): {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.days_remaining }}\nAvailable study time per day: {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.hours_per_day }} hours\nChapters to cover: {{ $('Calculate Remaining Days').item.json.chapters }}\nPrevious plans of this student (may be empty, use only to avoid repeating the same weak topics): {{ JSON.stringify($json.data || []).slice(0, 1200) }}\n\nHARD RULES - never break these\n1. Use ONLY the chapters listed above. Never invent a topic that is not in that list.\n2. Daily budget = hours_per_day x 60 minutes. Work in 50-minute blocks with 10-minute breaks; breaks are NOT counted. The sum of all block \"minutes\" of a day MUST equal that day's \"total_minutes\".\n3. Each block is between 25 and 50 minutes. 2 to 4 blocks per day.\n4. Produce DETAILED days (with blocks) only for the first 7 days, or for days_remaining if it is smaller. Start at Today. Dates must be real consecutive ISO dates (yyyy-MM-dd).\n5. For any remaining days, do not invent blocks. Instead write one short line per day-range in \"roadmap\", e.g. \"Days 8-11: Geometry - theory then 20 past-paper questions\".\n6. The final 2 days before the exam contain NO new chapter. Only: full review, timed past papers, and repair of weak points.\n7. Every day except the first starts with a 10-15 minute retrieval block on the previous day's material, method \"Active recall\", closed notes.\n8. Insert one lighter day every 7 days: 50% of the usual time, review only. Burnout is a failure of the plan, not of the student.\n9. Distribute chapters by weight: a hard or large chapter gets more blocks than an easy one. Do not give every chapter the same time.\n\nQUALITY OF EACH BLOCK - this is what makes the plan useful\n- \"topic\": the exact chapter or a precise sub-topic of it.\n- \"task\": a concrete, countable action. BAD: \"Study Algebra\". GOOD: \"Solve 8 exercises on quadratic inequalities, then redo the 2 you got wrong without looking at the solution.\"\n- \"method\": exactly one of - Active recall / Practice problems / Feynman explanation / Timed past paper / Flashcards / Error-log review / Summary sheet.\n- \"start_label\": a relative label such as \"Block 1 (0-50 min)\", never a clock time - the student chooses when to start.\n- \"focus\": one sentence naming the measurable outcome of that day.\n- \"tasks\": a short checklist (3-5 lines) summarising the same day, for a student who only reads the checklist.\n- \"priority\": \"HIGH\" if days_remaining <= 7 or chapters/days_remaining > 1, \"MEDIUM\" if days_remaining <= 21, otherwise \"NORMAL\".\n\nReturn JSON only, matching the schema. No markdown, no commentary.",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "c3a4fd14-fd14-4189-97ff-b602ccc5dc69",
      "name": "Parse Daily Plan",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "position": [
        16912,
        3360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"priority\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"roadmap\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"daily_plan\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"date\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"focus\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"total_minutes\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"tasks\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"blocks\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"start_label\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"topic\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"task\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"method\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"minutes\": {\"type\": \"number\"}}, \"required\": [\"start_label\", \"topic\", \"task\", \"method\", \"minutes\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}}, \"required\": [\"date\", \"focus\", \"total_minutes\", \"tasks\", \"blocks\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}}, \"required\": [\"priority\", \"roadmap\", \"daily_plan\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
